<title>UK: DB Capital Markets sets warrants on lire/mark.</title>
<headline>DB Capital Markets sets warrants on lire/mark.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>DB Capital Markets (Deutschland) has issued two million American-style put warrants, in two equal tranches, on the Italian lire/mark exchange rate, lead manager Deutsche Bank Ag said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 24.JAN.97-16.MAR.98   PAYDATE	24.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRANKFURT, DUSSELDORF</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  ITL/DEM 1.0299</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRIKE     ISSUE     PREMIUM     GEARING</p>
<p> PUT	  1.0 DEM    2.49 DEM  5.32 PCT    41.36 X</p>
<p> PUT	  1.05 DEM   5.91 DEM  3.79 PCT    17.43 X</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
